            <ArticleTitle>Pharmacological treatment of acute coronary syndromes.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>296-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many trials have examined the efficacy of medications used in acute coronary syndromes. This paper reviews those now recommended in patients with unstable angina and non-ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction. There are currently seven groups of drugs that are used in the management of such patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
